            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Nam Bo",
            "review_text": "Aleferetti\nRome, Italy27 contributions\n0\nService far from brillant but good food!\nOct 2015 • Couples\nI been there on sunday the place was well populated mostly big tables prices are reasonable once compared with the quality even if before try the food can seem to be expensive!\nThe waiters push too much for the customers to purchase expensive items (i do not exclude the items to deeserve that prices)\nMost of the menu have market prices witch make customers ask for prices (i would not be surprised if prices change from customer to customer) the waiter that served me ask my lady in vietnamese to get a big dish saying that looking at my size there would be no leftover from that even if he heard me talking vietnamese.\nThat is something quite TERRIBLE in a restaurant that want to work with high level of customers.\nProbably this non small detail spoiled my whole dinner.\nAnd i would not suggest this restaurant for foreigners.\nBy the way the location is nice.\nRead more\nWritten October 6, 2015",
